      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1871 the Portsmouth, Great Falls & Conway Railroad reached Ossipee Corner, and by 1875 it extended to Center Ossipee, sparking a tourism boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
