      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ossipee%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Grant Hall hosts the Ossipee Historical Society Museum, where artifacts from early settlers and the town’s textile industry are displayed.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
